      "content": "It cut off at the end there. Can you finish that last sentence for me?\n\nAlso, could we add a small note to the email addressing the nature of these fluctuations? Sometimes with these older systems, the temperature doesn't just drift slowly; it can be quite erratic—dropping suddenly or spiking without any obvious mechanical reason. Can you add a sentence that acknowledges these unpredictable variances so tenants aren't caught off guard by the instability? Just keep it professional.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
